sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Dashboard UI
    participant A as /api/substitutions
    participant T as /api/timetable
    participant DB as PostgreSQL via Prisma
    participant W as WebUntis
    participant M as Matching

    U->>UI: Öffnet Dashboard mit scope=personal
    UI->>A: GET /api/substitutions?date=YYYYMMDD
    A->>W: POST substitution/data
    W-->>A: Vertretungs-Rohdaten
    A-->>UI: normalisierte API-Antwort
    UI->>T: GET /api/timetable
    T->>DB: Stundenplan des Users laden
    DB-->>T: TimetableEntry[]
    T-->>UI: Stundenplan-Einträge
    UI->>M: findRelevantSubstitutions(substitutions, entries, selectedDate)
    M-->>UI: MatchResult[]
    UI->>UI: gefilterte persönliche Liste rendern
